          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            A laptop power bank is worth buying on two numbers only: the wattage of its best USB-C port and its capacity in watt-hours. Match the first to your laptop charger, expect the second to deliver about one full laptop charge, and pair the bank with a cable rated for the wattage you need.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
